OL,3,GNEWSAVictim's family 'let down' by
OL,4,Ajustice system after killer disappears
OL,5,Aduring father's funeral
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe sister of a man whose killer has
OL,8,Fbeen on the run for eight days has said
OL,9,Fher family had no idea he had been
OL,10,Freleased from prison to attend his
OL,11,Ffather's funeral until after he
OL,12,Fabsconded.
OL,14,FGary Anderson and his brother Sean were
OL,15,Fjailed for life in 2023 for the murder
OL,16,Fof Karol Kelly in Londonderry in 2018.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
