OL,3,GNEWSAVictim's family 'let down' by
OL,4,Ajustice system after killer disappears
OL,5,Aduring father's funeral
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnderson was freed from Maghaberry
OL,8,Fprison for two hours last Monday after
OL,9,Fa court sitting the previous day
OL,10,Foverturned a decision by the Northern
OL,11,FIreland Prison Service (NIPS) not to
OL,12,Frelease him.
OL,14,FFrancesca Kelly said the failings had
OL,15,Fbeen "at the highest level" and will
OL,16,Fmeet face-to-face with the Justice
OL,17,FMinister Naomi Long later this week.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
